  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-04-25T06:06:24.730Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new Camera feature is great, and is sure to see a lot of use. But I feel it can also allow for some great new personalization opportunities as well. An option to replace the lens that players see with a custom model in the same way we can change avatars could be very interesting and even make it easier for players to identify what camera belongs to who beyond the nameplates above them.",
